      "writtenOn": "2021-02-25T02:51:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on my understanding of initArchModule (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/arch.go;l\u003d923;drc\u003d9448e8fd56e11dc1444644e8e498be2ccccd5839):\n\nIt\u0027s a list of list of arch-specific props for each property struct (e.g. BaseCompilerProperties, BaseLinkerProperties) the module has. archProperties is constructed in the same order as m.GetProperties, so it\u0027s a way to access the arch-specific prop values of a specific struct.\n\npseudocode:\n\n  var archProperties [][]interface{}\n  for p in module.get_properties():\n     var arch_props []interface{}\n     for arch_prop in global_cached_arch_props(module, p)\n         arch_props +\u003d process(arch_prop)\n     archProperties +\u003d arch_props",
      "parentUuid": "059fed41_138351ce",
